<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11588"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Witchking<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 15, 2005 - 1:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I do believe I&#39;m going on a long sabbatical &#40;I know I said this before but I was requested back&#41;. Other life events await. I&#39;ll read Robert Beattie&#39;s book just like everyone and wonder to myself how many chances the WPD had and missed. I&#39;ll wonder until it&#39;s answered if it ever is what Nancy Fox said to him that gave Dennis cranial meltdown. It sticks with him yet today, I KNOW IT. Gail &#40;Gayle?&#41; Sorenson and Linda Shawn Casey ARE BTK&#39;s. I&#39;ve been fairly correct in my postings, info I&#39;ve shared and tried to keep with the spirit of the board sans one post and website the WPD didn&#39;t dig. I was one of the first to mention he had a recording device with him. I say this not to brag and why would anyone brag about this sorry case but to show there were CERTAIN things I made myself privvy to and shared when it became necessary. <BR> <BR>You have all been VERY VERY informative and there are many here I&#39;ll not smote as you&#39;re good people with good hearts who do truly seek justice for those being denied it. It&#39;s nice to hang in a community of intelligent, inquisitive people who enjoy what I enjoy, sleuthing. I do tend to take mine to another level sometimes which is either really cool or really foolish. <BR> <BR>I&#39;ll still be around to read your posts from time to time and if you wanna reach me you can find me in the realm of Angmar or in the web ether at: <BR> <BR><a href="http://witchkingofangmar.blogspot.com/" target=_top>http://witchkingofangmar.blogspot.com/</a> <BR> <BR>or <BR> <BR><a href="mailto:witchkingofangmar@comcast.net">witchkingofangmar@comcast.net</a> <BR> <BR> <BR>Lemme know when you all decide which serial killer we&#39;re going to make life uncomfortable for. I&#39;m in. Wichita was nice but cold, maybe you&#39;ll find a serial killer in a warm climate or at least closer to me &#40;20 minutes from Kerri Rader&#41;. <BR> <BR>Witch King<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11588-->
<!--Post: 11589--><!--Time: 1110926790-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11589"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 15, 2005 - 2:46 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->So long dear friend...I trusted your insight immediately - one of those intuition things....I am a native of Wichita and back in my teenage days - graduate of 1971 - we and all my friends called it doo-dah....&#40;smile&#41; and promptly left for a world of better opportunity...I will never forget you...I will always always remember posting back and forth and reading your posts those climaxing days right before the filth of Wichita was apprehended. <BR>I am one that does beleive without your leads and contacts to LE - well, it worked WitchKing... <BR>Thank-you forever <BR>Stay in touch <BR>I will continue to e-mail you! <BR><IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/sad.gif" ALT=":-&#40;" BORDER=0> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11589-->
