<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11633"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:rwmm@swbell.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 15, 2005 - 10:48 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Bye Witch King....it does seem as though this site is winding down, especially since Tom - the moderator of common sense and mindless postings- has been absent for much too long. Remember the good &#39;ole days when Tom would delete repetitive and off-topic ramblings? Some of us would get angry, but in hindsight it was the right thing to do. The board was much more informative, factual and useful. Now...well, time will tell! Stay in touch...Lily<!--/Text--></td></tr>
